Build-Depends: dpkg-dev (>= 1.19.0)
Rules-Requires-Root: no
Standards-Version: 4.7.2
Homepage: https://github.com/Nsch11/maya44-linux

Package: maya44e-dkms
Architecture: amd64
Depends: dkms (>= 3.2), alsa-utils, libasound2t64, python3
Recommends: linux-headers-generic
Description: experimental ALSA kernel driver for ESI MAYA44 PCIe cards
 This package provides source for the snd-maya44e kernel module.
 DKMS builds the module for supported kernels with installed headers.
 Analog playback and capture have been exercised on the MAYA44e.
 MAYA44 XTe and MAYA44 eX support is experimental.

Package: maya44e-mixer
Architecture: all
Depends: alsa-utils, libasound2t64, pipewire-bin, pulseaudio-utils,
 python3, python3-pyqt6, qt6-svg-plugins, qt6-wayland
Recommends: maya44e-dkms, wireplumber
Description: Qt mixer for ESI MAYA44 PCIe cards
 A Plasma system tray mixer with analog and S/PDIF controls,
 live meters, and English and Russian translations.
 Includes optional WirePlumber configuration for separate stereo outputs.
